==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*gelH-}}{{dercat|ru|ine-bsl-pro|ine-pro}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|глава}}, borrowed from {{der|ru|cu|глава}}.

{{doublet|ru|голова́}}, the regular East Slavic reflex.

Compare typologically {{m+|la|capitāneus}} (whence {{m|ru|капита́н}}) < {{m|la|caput}} (whence also {{m|ru|шеф}}). Also compare typologically {{m+|la|capitulum}} (whence {{m+|en|chapter}}), {{m+|grc|κεφάλαιον}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|глава́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-глава.ogg}}

===Noun===
